      "title": "phytools: an R package for phylogenetic comparative biology (and other things)",
      "abstract": "<jats:title>Summary</jats:title><jats:p><jats:bold>1.</jats:bold>\u2002Here, I present a new, multifunctional phylogenetics package, phytools, for the R statistical computing environment.</jats:p><jats:p><jats:bold>2.</jats:bold>\u2002The focus of the package is on methods for phylogenetic comparative biology; however, it also includes tools for tree inference, phylogeny input/output, plotting, manipulation and several other tasks.</jats:p><jats:p><jats:bold>3.</jats:bold>\u2002I describe and tabulate the major methods implemented in phytools, and in addition provide some demonstration of its use in the form of two illustrative examples.</jats:p><jats:p><jats:bold>4.</jats:bold>\u2002Finally, I conclude by briefly describing an active web\u2010log that I use to document present and future developments for phytools. I also note other web resources for phylogenetics in the R computational environment.</jats:p>",
